	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You call upon the power of water, forming a fog cloud where you reach out your hand.</em></p><p><strong>Utility</strong></p><ul><li><p>You create a 20-foot-radius sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The sphere spreads around corners.</p></li><li><p><strong>Area Hazard:</strong> The area is &amp;reference[heavilyobscured]. It lasts for the duration or until a wind of moderate or greater speed (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses it. This spell also doesn't function underwater.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Upcasting:</strong> The radius of the spell increases by 20 ft. for each spell level above 1st level.</p>",
			"chat": ""
		},
